# moby-subtick-corpus.manifest - rows of tests/harness/check_moby_subtick.sh.
#   <bk2> | <lo>-<hi> | pairs=<n> class=<n> [dmax=<px>] [| leg|seam <vbl> <moby> <reason>]...
#   bk2    a movie under games/spyro-2/bk2
#   span   intermediate-capture VBLs, two apart; exclusions name the VBL the
#          [moby-anim] trace prints
# The first dialogue in Glimmer: Pogo (class 0x22a) blends out of animation 0
# into animation 3 over trace VBLs 1466-1476, the two class 0x1f0 NPCs switch
# animation at 1562 and 1644, and classes 0x78 and 0x244 blend into keyframe 0
# at their loop wraps. Moby 80174c14 crosses world buckets between ticks: a
# base taken at the newest tick's position words reads 41 alpha-0 bases 1 to
# 3 buckets off the stored one.
glimmer-pogo-dialogue.bk2 | 1423-1659 | pairs=844 class=30 wbase=90
# Hurricos: each fan is three blade mobys of class 0x046 whose colour word
# carries bit 30, so the cull composes 12-bit angles byte<<4 | nibble out of
# the colour word (mobydraw.s:229-230, 645-649, 710-714, 777-780); the blades spin
# 128/4096 per tick about one axis.
pose:hurricos:pos=(41500, 91104, 30875) yaw=-2027 pitch=992 | 2471-2477 | pairs=9 turn=9 | seam 2474 8018d49c class 0x04d leg with no non-class leg in the span, D 0, outside the turn bin | seam 2476 8018d49c class 0x04d leg with no non-class leg in the span, D 0, outside the turn bin | seam 2478 8018d49c class 0x04d leg with no non-class leg in the span, D 0, outside the turn bin
